{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9f2786e62dfd3d3e08d0752a5b351d0c94767cdb5c5d3ba6ec7414feb2dae0e3", "ja": "（これから静香のグラビア撮影だ。水上運動会の\n後だからな、疲れていないといいけど……）", "zh": "（接下来是静香的写真拍摄。毕竟刚参加完水上运动会，希望她没有累着……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "c7b6f33cb64a7815dbd2880f4abcf2b4a442f735d1239148e0cf83029d81624f", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nしっかり準備できました。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n已经做好充分准备了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4b3e746ae46ece00400360450d45c68ab205009ce0fab77423784327bae69abe", "ja": "お疲れ様、静香。大丈夫か？\n結構ハードなスケジュールになっちゃったけど。", "zh": "辛苦了，静香。还好吗？\n日程安排得挺紧的，可能有点辛苦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "c5f6f16537326fae1ae09cb4b1f394d161fbd461bde4b661ba8a52c4a47df289", "ja": "そうですね。慣れないことをしたので、\nちょっとだけ疲れてるかもしれないです。", "zh": "是啊。做了平时不习惯的事，\n可能稍微有点累了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "fa5562e14806ee4fabf8442b797cd3b19624a37720fd00d1af9aab5e3446bc39", "ja": "変わった競技が多かったですよね、水上運動会。\n水上玉入れとか、水上綱引きとか。", "zh": "水上运动会有好多奇怪的项目呢。\n比如水上投球、水上拔河什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "e5ad3a41625b07ecbf99f03cd2bfbac30fc14cf3c1dd37c2b5cc2f8aad5921f3", "ja": "特に、障害物競争！　あれが一番大変でした。\n容赦なく落としに掛かってくるし……。", "zh": "尤其是障碍赛！那真是最辛苦的项目了。\n还毫不留情地想把人弄掉下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1006_p", "source_sha256": "174cf5751005e71740a2d81a7bd95cf3130efd76bee2b4e5367828e055763372", "ja": "そうだな。でも静香が落ちた時は、\nすごく盛り上がってたぞ。", "zh": "是啊。不过静香掉下去的时候，现场气氛特别热烈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "d82a54aabcfc848d011d937a6f4a7008441b953ec39fb49124a747a2a4a2b834", "ja": "本当ですか？　でもあれは可奈のおかげというか……。\nはぁ……やっぱりバラエティ番組って難しいな。", "zh": "真的吗？不过那次多亏了可奈才会……。\n唉……综艺节目果然很难啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "f3305b0386c7a275f658ed2cac986d3c559aceea173409fa89a918e1feab1422", "ja": "本番前まで、優勝するつもりでいたんです。\nそのつもりだったんですけど……。", "zh": "直到正式开始前，我一直都打算拿冠军的。\n当时确实是这么打算的，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "ccf726d87707767ba74bcdd31e53ddc3c50320f9942fdfe037decfeef58c1373", "ja": "番組が始まったら、迷ってしまって。勝つことと\n目立つこと……求められてるのはどっちだろう？って。", "zh": "节目开始后，我反而迷茫了。到底是获胜，还是出风头……节目想要的究竟是哪一个呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7593b21c5a091e88d805316859eaa77ee69f7766501ea3bfde20fd61aff5afd6", "ja": "そうだったのか。まあ、バラエティ番組としては、\n『おいしい場面』の方が撮れ高はあるかな。", "zh": "原来如此。嗯，作为综艺节目来说，能拍到“精彩镜头”的话，节目效果应该会更好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "de0fa9742033c79b49a3365a64ba7e974eaf4b91b7f48dd9902c311379cac2cf", "ja": "そう、ですよね……。", "zh": "也是，呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1012_p", "source_sha256": "194dacdb8d9d346968182cd1cefaaa0998458deb3afe2cc0623e04f6e27c105f", "ja": "深く考えなくても、静香はそのままでいいと思うよ。\nいつものままで、笑いは取れるんだし。", "zh": "不用想太多，我觉得静香保持原样就好。照平时那样，也能逗人笑嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "e6214b1e2334b289b1da62d049d67f0fa4d6033ec3ee4e71122af860d62e182e", "ja": "えっ……{$P$}、\nそれって、普段の私がバラエティ向きってことですか？", "zh": "诶……{$P$}，\n你的意思是说，平时的我很适合上综艺吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "4d3cdf99b5dacaacce240188570f5fd3b316dac1a91344d4fef21d6ba7212a73", "ja": "私、どっちかっていうと真面目過ぎるっていうか、\n面白みのない方だと思うんですけど……。", "zh": "我觉得自己要说的话，与其说是太认真，\n不如说是个没什么趣味的人……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0144a86fcc3706b021762604f9366ad6900fa132c9b0ee4d303a1af6b58c6696", "ja": "えっ、そう……？\nいやまあ、真面目だとは思うけど。", "zh": "诶，是吗……？\n嗯，我是觉得你挺认真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0a9fd98f6d3ed1e6b98cd2d421f6f7338fa1177d299ec710081afe92ad150097", "ja": "向いてるとか向いてないとかは、あまり考えないな。\nどんな仕事でも、静香らしくやればいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "我倒是没怎么考虑过适不适合之类的问题。\n无论什么工作，只要按照静香自己的风格去做不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "70a485a23abb1125cb001c253d93b98306c0bacc8b4c18e01fee97e7b51e1afe", "ja": "どんな仕事でも……そっか。\n自分で仕事の幅を狭めること、ないですもんね。", "zh": "不管是什么工作……这样啊。\n没必要自己限制工作的范围呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "795527d505673513e52f71c905bf836ba538d73d32dde457fce971fdb011f81b", "ja": "そのままの私でいい、か……ふふっ。\nなんだか、気持ちが軽くなったかも！", "zh": "就这样做自己就好……是吗……呵呵。\n总觉得心情轻松多了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0264_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "6939641cea574e57c291e66379bf94bc3c736e133a751e99174616c7a4bf084e", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}。\nこの後の撮影も、私らしく頑張りますね！", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}。\n接下来的拍摄，我也会以自己的方式努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
